stateDiagram-v2
    state "Read bootstrap output" as Capture
    state "Complete output in context" as Small
    state "File path, size and hash in context" as Large
    state "Capture failed visibly" as Failed
    [*] --> Capture
    Capture --> Small: At most 40,000 bytes
    Capture --> Large: More than 40,000 bytes
    Capture --> Failed: Read or storage fails

    state "Select current rules and cards" as Select
    state "Full fresh rules and cards" as Full
    state "One line referencing prior pack" as Reference
    state "Existing diagnostics or refusal" as Guard
    state "No receipt" as Silent
    [*] --> Select
    Select --> Full: Unseen rule or card
    Select --> Reference: Complete repeat at PreToolUse
    Select --> Guard: Selection incomplete or fails
    Select --> Silent: No matching rules or cards
    Reference --> Full: Context, corpus or agent changes
    Reference --> Full: Newly applicable rule or card
